{"questions":[{"id":"Q091","typeId":"房間空缺","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S01:p1","S12:p4"],"prompt":"採樣隊入住基地，每艙5人會有18人無艙可住；每艙8人則剛好空出2艙。下列哪一個艙數符合兩條件？若不存在符合條件的整數艙數，選「無解」。","answer":"無解","explanation":"5x+18＝8(x−2)，3x＝34，因此艙數不是整數，條件不可能。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"5*x+18=8*(x-2)","root":"34/3","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c3","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"20/3","misconception":"將空2艙誤當成空2人，錯列5x+18＝8x−2；空艙代表16個床位。"},{"id":"c2","text":"6","misconception":"只將18名無艙者除以每艙增加3人，忽略空出的2艙。"},{"id":"c3","text":"無解"},{"id":"c4","text":"12","misconception":"列式所得34/3被直接進位；艙數必須是整數且原兩式完全相等。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q094","typeId":"雞兔同籠","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S09:p1"],"prompt":"研究站有雙足與四足巡檢機共26台，接地支腳合計82隻。雙足機有幾台？","answer":"11","explanation":"2x+4(26−x)＝82，x＝11。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"2*x+4*(26-x)=82","root":"11","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c2","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"13","misconception":"把26台平均分成兩種，未檢查支腳總數是否為82。"},{"id":"c2","text":"11"},{"id":"c3","text":"41","misconception":"直接將82除以2，忽略其中有四足機，且總台數只有26。"},{"id":"c4","text":"15","misconception":"這是四足機的台數；雙足機應以26減去15。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q095","typeId":"兩種單價總額","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S10:p1","S14:p4","S18:p1"],"prompt":"軌道展館售出320張票，一般票80元、學員票50元，收入21700元。學員票幾張？","answer":"130","explanation":"50x+80(320−x)＝21700，x＝130。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"50*x+80*(320-x)=21700","root":"130","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c3","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"320","misconception":"直接把售出總張數當成學員票張數，沒有利用兩種票價與總收入。"},{"id":"c2","text":"190","misconception":"這是一般票張數；學員票應為320減去190。"},{"id":"c3","text":"130"},{"id":"c4","text":"78","misconception":"把收入差3900元除以學員票價50；每改一張學員票只少收30元。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q097","typeId":"單價差額","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S10:p1","S11:p2","S12:p4","S16:p1"],"prompt":"映彤買3張標準票和4張優惠票，共720元。標準票每張比優惠票貴30元。標準票多少元？","answer":"120","explanation":"設優惠票x，3(x+30)+4x＝720，x＝90。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"3*(x+30)+4*x=720","root":"90","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c1","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"120"},{"id":"c2","text":"90","misconception":"這是優惠票的單價；標準票必須再加30元。"},{"id":"c3","text":"750/7","misconception":"以標準票價列式時只扣一次30；4張優惠票應共扣4×30元。"},{"id":"c4","text":"600/7","misconception":"把優惠票誤當成比標準票貴30；優惠票應為標準票減30。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q099","typeId":"買物盈虧","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S10:p1"],"prompt":"祐甄買6本手冊會剩42元，買10本則差70元。每本多少元？","answer":"28","explanation":"6x+42＝10x−70，得x＝28。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"6*x+42=10*x-70","root":"28","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c3","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"112","misconception":"只求兩方案相差的112元；還要除以相差的4本。"},{"id":"c2","text":"7","misconception":"將差70與剩42相減；兩種購買量間的金額差應為70+42。"},{"id":"c3","text":"28"},{"id":"c4","text":"14","misconception":"把相差4本誤算成8本；10−6才是增加的本數。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q100","typeId":"互轉金錢","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S13:p1","S13:p2"],"prompt":"季禾與若棠共有1440點；季禾轉給若棠90點後，季禾是若棠的3倍。若棠原有幾點？","answer":"270","explanation":"設若棠x，1440−x−90＝3(x+90)，x＝270。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"1440-x-90=3*(x+90)","root":"270","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c4","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"292.5","misconception":"只增加若棠90點卻沒扣季禾90點；轉帳兩方必須同步增減。"},{"id":"c2","text":"360","misconception":"這是轉帳後若棠點數；題目問原有點數，還要減90。"},{"id":"c3","text":"337.5","misconception":"只扣除季禾的90點，漏掉若棠也收到90點；右側應為3(x+90)。"},{"id":"c4","text":"270"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q101","typeId":"三袋轉移","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S14:p5"],"prompt":"三個盒子原有相同數量的晶片。從第一盒移4片到第二盒，再從第二盒移7片到第三盒，此時第三盒是第二盒的2倍。原本三盒共幾片？","answer":"39","explanation":"x+7＝2(x+4−7)，x＝13，合計39。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"x+7=2*(x+4-7)","root":"13","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c1","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"39"},{"id":"c2","text":"43","misconception":"只記第二盒收到4片卻漏扣第一盒4片；盒間轉移不會增加晶片總數。"},{"id":"c3","text":"63","misconception":"忽略從第一盒轉入第二盒的4片，誤列x+7＝2(x−7)；第二盒應為x−3。"},{"id":"c4","text":"13","misconception":"只求得每盒原有13片；原本三盒合計要乘3。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q102","typeId":"鈔票總值","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S02:p3","S14:p6"],"prompt":"百元禮券張數是五百元禮券的2倍；五百元禮券總值比百元禮券多1800元。百元禮券幾張？","answer":"12","explanation":"500x−100×2x＝1800，x＝6，百元券12張。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"500*x-100*2*x=1800","root":"6","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c2","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"18","misconception":"以1800除以100，忽略兩種禮券總值的差額關係。"},{"id":"c2","text":"12"},{"id":"c3","text":"6","misconception":"這是五百元禮券張數；百元禮券張數還要乘2。"},{"id":"c4","text":"9","misconception":"將每份價值差誤作400元；一張五百元券應對應兩張百元券，差300元。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q104","typeId":"配分題數","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S02:p5","S13:p2"],"prompt":"闖關共32題，前段每題4分、後段每題2分，滿分100分。從第幾題開始每題2分？","answer":"19","explanation":"4x+2(32−x)＝100，前段18題，從19題起。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"4*x+2*(32-x)=100","root":"18","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c4","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"14","misconception":"這是每題2分的題數；題目問後段開始的題號。"},{"id":"c2","text":"18","misconception":"這是每題4分的題數；每題2分的第一題編號要再加1。"},{"id":"c3","text":"25","misconception":"直接以100除以4，忽略後段仍有每題2分的題目。"},{"id":"c4","text":"19"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q105","typeId":"答題倒扣","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S11:p1","S12:p3"],"prompt":"俊熙作答24題，答對得6分，答錯扣3分，未答0分，總分117分。答對幾題？","answer":"21","explanation":"6x−3(24−x)＝117，9x＝189。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"6*x-3*(24-x)=117","root":"21","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c1","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"21"},{"id":"c2","text":"15","misconception":"把答錯扣3分改成加3分，誤列6x+3(24−x)＝117。"},{"id":"c3","text":"24","misconception":"以作答題數當成答對題數；若全對應得144分而非117。"},{"id":"c4","text":"19.5","misconception":"以總分直接除以6，忽略答錯題目會扣分。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q107","typeId":"瓶裝容量混合","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S13:p1"],"prompt":"基地收到24瓶溶液，每瓶為400或1000毫升，合計15600毫升。1000毫升有幾瓶？","answer":"10","explanation":"1000x+400(24−x)＝15600，x＝10。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"1000*x+400*(24-x)=15600","root":"10","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c3","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"15.6","misconception":"將全部容量除以1000，忽略其中還有400毫升的瓶子。"},{"id":"c2","text":"26","misconception":"以15600直接除以600，漏掉24瓶各400毫升的基本容量9600。"},{"id":"c3","text":"10"},{"id":"c4","text":"14","misconception":"這是400毫升溶液的瓶數；1000毫升的瓶數為24減14。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q108","typeId":"杯量餘量","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S13:p1"],"prompt":"同一壺果汁倒滿5杯後剩460毫升，倒滿9杯後剩60毫升。原本果汁幾毫升？","answer":"960","explanation":"5x+460＝9x+60，杯容量100毫升，原量960。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"5*x+460=9*x+60","root":"100","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c4","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"100","misconception":"只求得每杯容量；原壺容量還要加回倒出五杯的500毫升。"},{"id":"c2","text":"500","misconception":"只算先倒出的五杯容量，漏算仍留在壺內的460毫升。"},{"id":"c3","text":"1360","misconception":"用九杯900毫升卻加上五杯方案的剩量460；應配對相同方案的剩量。"},{"id":"c4","text":"960"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"}]}